# A test resource for this building block. Every .ttl file in this directory is
# validated against shapes.shacl when the register is built.
#
# As shipped this file asserts nothing: an empty graph has no node for a shape to
# target, so it passes without testing anything. Replace the commented instance
# below with data typed by one of the classes this profile documents.
#
# @prefix ex: <https://example.org/> .
#
# ex:instance a <https://example.org/vocab#DocumentedType> ;
#     <https://example.org/vocab#documentedProperty> "a value" .
#
# Every resource here must conform: a .ttl the shapes reject fails the register
# build. See the bblocks documentation for declaring a resource that is meant to
# fail — the -fail filename convention is documented for JSON test resources.
